  "card": "Fixes request body deserialization for binary and hex POST requests to /rest/getutxos. Serializing the raw payload with operator<< prepended a CompactSize length, misaligning decoded fields and causing valid POST requests to report no UTXO hits. The change parses the body in place using SpanReader, bounds vector deserialization before allocation, rejects trailing unparsed bytes and malformed hex, and rejects zero-outpoint requests.",
